      "lineNbr": 10,
      "author": {
        "id": 1165921
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-03-11T17:44:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wonder if we should instead have separate I2C and SPI bindings here.\n\nThe problem is that when upstreaming it I very much doubt it would make sense like this.\n\nWe can then have some macro stuff in config_chip.h to produce the required thing for ECOS",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 10,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 10,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "d26d642b3eb74deddc99b8ae05161a516171e544",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
