        "id": 1245946
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-03-11T23:36:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Everything here is ECOS specific things. I believe we can assume ECOS is a kind of virtual device and what we have here is for configuring the device. I mean things here are very ECOS internal specific. When we upstream this, it\u0027s like upstream a driver(and some user space) for a completely new device. So I believe there\u0027s no need to have an extra step.",
      "parentUuid": "a74858e8_cf17abeb",
      "range": {
